### Register a donor
POST http://localhost:5000/api/donors/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Raj Kumar",
  "email": "raj@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "bloodGroup": "O+",
  "dob": "1995-05-15"
}

### Get all donors
GET http://localhost:5000/api/donors

### Create blood unit
POST http://localhost:5000/api/blood-units/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorId": "6adb03a0119222396ab19e79",
  "bloodGroup": "O+",
  "collectionDate": "2026-10-01",
  "expiryDate": "2028-10-16"
}

### Get available O+ units
GET http://localhost:5000/api/blood-units/available/O+

### Create emergency request
POST http://localhost:5000/api/emergency-requests/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospitalName": "City Hospital",
  "bloodGroup": "O+",
  "quantity": 1,
  "urgency": "critical"
}

### Get all emergency requests
GET http://localhost:5000/api/emergency-requests

### Update testing status to cleared (replace UNIT_ID with _id from "Create blood unit" response)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/blood-units/6adb056e119222396ab19e7d/test-status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "testingStatus": "cleared"
}